# Copy to frontend/.env for local dev.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed VITE_, and it substitutes them at BUILD
# time — the value is compiled into the bundle, so changing it means rebuilding,
# not restarting. Never put a secret in here.
#
# Same Client ID as the API's GACA_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID. The duplication exists
# because the API reads its copy from the environment at runtime while the
# frontend needs a VITE_-prefixed one at build time.
# Get one from https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#
# Leave unset and the Google button simply doesn't render — email and password
# sign-in still works.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
